        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What are the biggest challenges for clothing startups?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">The biggest challenges for clothing startups include finding manufacturers with accessible MOQs, managing production timelines, ensuring quality control, understanding fabric selection, and managing cash flow for production. We address these challenges through low minimums, transparent communication, quality assurance systems, fabric expertise, and flexible payment terms.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you offer brand development support?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We offer brand development support including design consultation, fabric selection guidance, sizing recommendations, and production planning. Our team helps startups refine their concepts for manufacturability, select appropriate materials for their target market, and plan production schedules that align with launch timelines and budget constraints.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How does scaling work with SDF?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Scaling with SDF follows a structured path starting with low MOQ production for market testing. As brands grow and demand increases, we can scale production while maintaining quality consistency. Our capacity accommodates growth from 300 pieces to thousands of pieces per style, with volume pricing benefits as production quantities increase.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What are your requirements for working with new brands?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Our requirements for new brands are minimal. We need basic design concepts or tech packs, target quantity specifications, and timeline requirements. We work with brands at all stages from concept to established businesses. No minimum annual volume commitment required, making us accessible to startups testing their first collections.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cta">
    <div class="section__container">
      <h2 class="section__title">Ready to Launch Your Clothing Brand?</h2>
      <p class="section__text">
        Contact SDF Clothing for startup clothing manufacturing support. We provide low MOQ production from 300 pieces, brand development guidance, tech pack assistance, fabric sourcing, and scaling support for new clothing brands. Bangladesh manufacturer for startups ready to help you launch successfully.
      </p>
      <div class="section__ctas">
        <a href="/contact/" class="section__cta section__cta--primary">Get Free Quote</a>
        <a href="/sampling-service" class="section__cta section__cta--secondary">Request Sample</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <p class="section__text--small">
        Related pages: <a href="/clothing-manufacturers-for-startups/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">clothing manufacturers for startups</a>, <a href="/best-clothing-manufacturer-for-startups" style="color: var(--color-primary);">best clothing manufacturer for startups</a>, <a href="/small-batch-clothing-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">small batch clothing manufacturer</a>, <a href="/private-label-clothing-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">private label manufacturer</a>, <a href="/tech-pack-service" style="color: var(--color-primary);">tech pack service</a>, <a href="/tools/moq-calculator/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">MOQ calculator</a>, <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-bangladesh" style="color: var(--color-primary);">clothing manufacturer Bangladesh</a>, <a href="/how-to-start-a-clothing-brand" style="color: var(--color-primary);">how to start a clothing brand</a>, <a href="/low-moq-clothing-manufacturers/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">low MOQ clothing manufacturers</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
